{
  "title": "Kissed Jamaican Water Chestnut Curry",
  "description": "A fresh, fluffy weeknight Jamaican curry that pairs water chestnuts with a namul-blanch-season and is ayurvedic sattvic friendly.",
  "cuisine": "Jamaican",
  "diet": [
    "gluten-free",
