      "name": "lime juice",
      "amount": "1 teaspoon"
    },
    {
      "name": "salt",
      "amount": "1 pinch"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Heat coconut oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add diced onion and sauté until translucent, about 3 minutes.",
    "Stir in minced garlic and grated ginger, cooking for another minute until fragrant.",
    "Add curry powder and allspice, tossing to coat the aromatics for 30 seconds.",
    "Pour in coconut milk and vegetable broth, bringing the mixture to a gentle simmer.",
    "Add sliced water chestnuts and simmer for 8 minutes until they soften.",
    "Fold in the namul-blanch-season and cook for an additional 2 minutes to warm the greens.",
    "Stir in lime juice and adjust seasoning with salt to taste.",
    "Serve the curry hot over steamed rice or with flatbread.",
    "Garnish with fresh cilantro if desired."
  ],
